          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So I never seen eye-to-eye with y'all niggas, ayo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Uno peso, never paid attention to what niggas gotta say-o",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "So I keep that buck, I ain't give no fuck",
